    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "A stalled/crashed watcher stops advancing this - climbing steadily means it's down (see the Layer 8 restart-resilience finding: no persistent read offset, so a restart loses whatever arrived during the downtime window).",
